  "upstream": [],
  "delta": [
    "P26: every P0 tool has a valid call and an invalid-arguments call executed by the real Bot runtime; ListRoutines' invalid case is the JSON-RPC non-object arguments check because the executor intentionally ignores members.",
    "P26: every P0 tool has a per-caller catalog denial (permission_denied) and unknown/P1 names stay unknown_tool; the shared card builder, memory, routine, task executor and approval coordinator are the real implementations, not a re-implementation.",
    "P26: UpdateMemory business refusals stay successful tool results (isError absent, ok:false + code), while argument/ownership failures are isError:true; RequestApproval returns the real coordinator outcome and consumes a once grant; Task/AwaitTask/StopSubagent use the executor record shape."
  ],
